{
  "dom_id": "step-37620",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "Suppose we have the graph of a function $y=f(x)$ to which we apply the following transformations in the order listed:\n\n1\\. translation by $\\color{blue}5$ units up\n\n2\\. translation by $\\color{red}4$ units left\n\n3\\. stretch by a scale factor of $\\color{purple}3$ parallel to the $y$-axis\n\nWhat is the final function expression after applying all the transformations?\n\nTo find the final expression, we apply each transformation in turn.\n\n1\\. Translating the graph of $y=f(x)$ up by $\\color{blue}5$ units is equivalent to adding $\\color{blue}5$ to the function expression. Applying this transformation, we obtain \n\n  $$\n  y=f(x)+{\\color{blue}5}.\n  $$\n\n2\\. Translating the graph of $y=f(x)+5$ by $\\color{red}4$ units to the left is equivalent to replacing every instance of $x$ with $(x+{\\color{red}{4}}).$ Applying this transformation, we obtain \n\n  $$\n  y =f(x+{\\color{red}4})+{\\color{blue}5}.\n  $$\n\n3\\. Stretching the graph of $y=f(x+4)+5$ by a scale factor of $\\color{purple}3$ parallel to the $y$-axis is equivalent to multiplying the function expression by $3.$ Applying this transformation, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =3\\cdot (f(x+4)+5) \\\\  & =3\\cdot f(x+4)+3\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =3f(x+4)+15.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the final function expression is \n\n$$\ny=3f(x+4)+15.\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-37620\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"37620\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"6206\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-37620\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-1\">Introduction</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"37620\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n       